        35.34652328491211
      ],
      "text": "RECOMMENDATIONS FOR MANAGEMENT OF COMMON CHILDHOOD CONDITIONS",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        60.617027282714844,
        78.65290069580078,
        72.75702667236328
      ],
      "text": "Risks",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        73.62702941894531,
        266.4529113769531,
        87.11702728271484
      ],
      "text": "There is no evidence of harm with this intervention.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        98.14559173583984,
        207.81297302246094,
        110.13558959960938
      ],
      "text": "5.3.3\t Acceptability and feasibility",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        113.80018615722656,
        399.0728759765625,
        127.2901840209961
      ],
      "text": "The intervention has a low cost and should be feasible to implement. However, it",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        126.80018615722656,
        399.102783203125,
        140.29019165039062
      ],
      "text": "requires acceptance by the mother, family, and community in general. Cultural",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        139.80018615722656,
        365.932861328125,
        153.29019165039062
      ],
      "text": "barriers might need to be overcome in order to implement this intervention.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        163.34780883789062,
        245.2549591064453,
        176.53680419921875
      ],
      "text": "5.4\t Management of neonatal jaundice",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        179.97349548339844,
        399.08282470703125,
        193.4635009765625
      ],
      "text": "1.\t Term and preterm neonates with hyperbilirubinaemia should be treated with",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        192.97349548339844,
        399.04150390625,
        206.4635009765625
      ],
      "text": "phototherapy or exchange transfusion guided by the following cut-off levels of",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        205.97349548339844,
        184.56146240234375,
        219.4635009765625
      ],
      "text": "serum hyperbilirubinaemia:",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        345.5657043457031,
        249.18499755859375,
        379.09576416015625,
        257.24200439453125
      ],
      "text": "NEWBORNS",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        330.22918701171875,
        260.18499755859375,
        394.43316650390625,
        268.24200439453125
      ],
      "text": "<35 WEEKS GESTATION",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        67.32279968261719,
        271.18499755859375,
        392.3122253417969,
        279.24200439453125
      ],
      "text": "AGE OR ANY RISK FACTORS",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "table"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        342.6824035644531,
        284.4339904785156,
        382.4263610839844,
        294.7929992675781
      ],
      "text": "220 mmol/l",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        67.32279968261719,
        289.9339904785156,
        85.61080169677734,
        300.2929992675781
      ],
      "text": "Day 1",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        343.6695861816406,
        295.4339904785156,
        379.4446105957031,
        305.7929992675781
      ],
      "text": "(10 mg/dL)",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        342.67608642578125,
        310.5710144042969,
        382.4290466308594,
        320.9300231933594
      ],
      "text": "260 mmol/l",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        67.32279968261719,
        316.0710144042969,
        85.61080169677734,
        326.4300231933594
      ],
      "text": "Day 2",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        343.67718505859375,
        321.5710144042969,
        379.4432067871094,
        331.9300231933594
      ],
      "text": "(15 mg/dL)",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        342.6162109375,
        336.7080078125,
        382.49517822265625,
        347.0670166015625
      ],
      "text": "340 mmol/l",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        67.32279968261719,
        342.2080078125,
        89.94880676269531,
        352.5670166015625
      ],
      "text": "Day >3",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        343.43701171875,
        347.7080078125,
        379.6710205078125,
        358.0670166015625
      ],
      "text": "(20 mg/dL)",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        370.41448974609375,
        284.8829650878906,
        384.3345031738281
      ],
      "text": "(Standard recommendation, very low quality evidence)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        386.67919921875,
        399.0828552246094,
        400.1692199707031
      ],
      "text": "2.\t Clinicians should ensure that all infants are routinely monitored for the",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        399.67919921875,
        396.8313293457031,
        413.1692199707031
      ],
      "text": "development of jaundice and serum bilirubin should be measured in those at risk:",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        412.67919921875,
        245.21153259277344,
        426.1692199707031
      ],
      "text": "—\t in all babies if jaundice appears on day 1",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        425.67919921875,
        317.071533203125,
        439.1692199707031
      ],
      "text": "—\t in preterm babies (<35 weeks) if jaundice appears on day 2",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        438.67919921875,
        289.7115783691406,
        452.1692199707031
      ],
      "text": "—\t in all babies if palms and soles are yellow at any age",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        454.08380126953125,
        268.1129455566406,
        468.0038146972656
      ],
      "text": "(Standard recommendation, very quality evidence)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        470.3484802246094,
        399.07281494140625,
        483.8385009765625
      ],
      "text": "3.\t Phototherapy should be stopped once serum bilirubin is 50 mmol/l (3 mg/dl) or",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        483.3484802246094,
        209.26145935058594,
        496.8385009765625
      ],
      "text": "below the phototherapy threshold.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        498.75311279296875,
        240.97286987304688,
        512.673095703125
      ],
      "text": "(Standard recommendation, expert opinion)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        515.017822265625,
        399.082763671875,
        528.5078125
      ],
      "text": "These suggested levels represent a consensus by the expert panel members based",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        528.017822265625,
        399.02288818359375,
        541.5078125
      ],
      "text": "on very limited evidence, and the levels shown are approximations consistent with",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        541.017822265625,
        399.0628662109375,
        554.5078125
      ],
      "text": "other international guidelines. The emphasis should be on preventive actions and",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        554.0177612304688,
        399.0329284667969,
        567.5077514648438
      ],
      "text": "risk evaluation where lower cut-offs for exchange transfusion may prevent some",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        567.0177612304688,
        399.0929870605469,
        580.5077514648438
      ],
      "text": "additional cases of kernicterus. This recommendation should be accompanied by a",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        580.0177612304688,
        332.8829345703125,
        593.5077514648438
      ],
      "text": "brief description on how to give phototherapy in clinical guidelines.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        222.42050170898438,
        644.9403076171875,
        230.6195068359375,
        655.2992553710938
      ],
      "text": "26",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
}